  title: King has fallen ill
  speakingCharacters:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f74c587975259d4f9962efdb1c258ff, type: 2}
    dialogueLines:
    - line: 'Advisor... the worst has happened. It seems like the King has fallen
        ill to the plague ravishing the kingdom. '
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'That is truly unfortunate. '
        responseToChoice: 'That does not even come close to the tragedy of this situation. '
        consequences: []
        dailyChanges: []
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
    - line: 'I will try to give the King medicine, but it might be too late - the
        plague had too much time to feed and grow, and medicine has less effect on
        it by now it seems. '
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'Let us hope for the best - the King is strong. '
        responseToChoice: But stronger than an invisible reaper? We will see...
        consequences: []
        dailyChanges: []
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
